    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Makeruna!! Aku no Gundan!",
        "jpn": "まけるな!! あくのぐんだん!"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The \"Evil Corps,\" led by Don, are on a mission to conquer the universe. They set out to invade Earth first, but they struggle as some quirky Earthlings stand in their way. Eventually Don's plan to invade Earth becomes distorted...?! This wacky slice-of-life sci-fi comedy stars a team of aliens you just can't hate and lots of unique Earthlings!",
        "jpn": "宇宙征服を目指すドン様率いる宇宙人グループ「あくのぐんだん」はまず手始めに地球征服のための行動を開始するが、なかなか思い通りにはいかないようで…。"
    },
